{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》總決賽於今（23日）於啟德體藝館隆重舉行。TVB翡翠台同時全程直播，七強選手包括尹景順、許美琪、蔡宓婕、尤淑情、許雲妮、吳亦偉以及鄭家聲。決賽由車婉婉鄭衍峰擔任主持，重量級歌手李克勤與巫啟賢擔任星級評審，聯同五大專業評審肥媽、周國豐、張佳添、海兒及谷婭溦，見證王者誕生。決賽賽制共分兩回合，首回合由終極7強各自演繹快、慢歌各一首，分數將與「觀眾最愛好聲音」的票數合計，累積總分最高的三位選手將晉級第二回合，以「必殺歌」決勝負。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"batch_WhatsApp Image 2026-08-23 at 19.01.26 (2).jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026x8wmoSPipT1787483135.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"batch_WhatsApp Image 2026-08-23 at 19.01.26 (2).jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"batch_WhatsApp Image 2026-08-23 at 18.51.41.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026LYyViDlXQn1787483136.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"batch_WhatsApp Image 2026-08-23 at 18.51.41.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>中年好聲音4決賽｜首回合決勝快歌</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> 1. 鄭家聲《鐵幕誘惑》</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2. 蔡宓婕《真情人》 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">3. 尹景順《大熱》</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">5. 許雲妮《I Will Survive》</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">6. 尤淑情《Bad Boy》 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">7.許美琪《Bad Romance》</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cf702c16-eb91-45cb-a14a-0900ee3f.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20262pjZByG9RW1787489956.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cf702c16-eb91-45cb-a14a-0900ee3f.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8bd1931b-19fe-4853-803a-22de4ce3.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20267vALpYZluj1787489970.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8bd1931b-19fe-4853-803a-22de4ce3.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e9432668-3c46-4314-b25e-d0aa31f4.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026dOosh0Oxdz1787490449.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: